e figures reflect secondary share sales, tender offers, and consensus estimates from institutional space-economy analysts (e.g., Morgan Stanley, Ark Invest).\",[[0,203,[[null,null,null,null,1]]]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Key Upside Catalysts\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Starlink Free Cash Flow Expansion\",[[0,33,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Starlink accounts for the lion’s share of enterprise value expansion. Increasing enterprise, maritime, and aviation broadband contracts, combined with high-margin Direct-to-Cell partnerships with global telecom operators, accelerate top-line recurring revenue.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Starship Operational Milestones\",[[0,31,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Transitioning Starship from test flights to routine orbital payload delivery radically drops the cost per kilogram to orbit. Successfully using Starship to deploy full-size next-gen Starlink satellites multiplies network capacity and lowers launch costs compared to Falcon 9.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Defense and Government Contracts\",[[0,32,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Expanded awards under the U.S. Space Force\"]]]]],1]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[\"compress\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/compress/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1002,\"Don't personalize\",2,null,[\"person_cancel\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/person_cancel/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1001,\"Try again\",1,null,[\"refresh\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/refresh/default/24px.svg\