 and continued Artemis Human Landing System (HLS) milestones, secure multibillion-dollar backlogs with guaranteed margins.\\n\\n4. **Starlink IPO / Partial Spin-Off Talk**  \\n   Any firm institutional step or SEC filing toward spinning out Starlink into a separate publicly traded company typically triggers a multiple re-rating on SpaceX’s holding valuation.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Key Downside Risks\\n\\n1. **Starship Development \\u0026 Reliability Bottlenecks**  \\n   Any major setbacks in rapid reusability or in-orbit refueling could\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,[1],\"en\",null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"New York, USA\",\"SWML_DESCRIPTION_FROM_YOUR_INTERNET_ADDRESS\",false,null,\"//www.google.com/maps/vt/data\\u003dPzO_nXY4izNuo_Sbup9urPsq-1pMoguhndYKTXW3aUaH1gaUmOyq-S0uQIJYoHHB5YSJNaQolioLSY2LXxJu2VnKAMq7r8TkIfZE7khKBQ7oZ8crivRbTxWHClZReoeQPacnNhszWSIWGyyE7bGZylTC8LtLuW-pLPjoZU2gQNLEiYFO-FOTIhEas7ZUOJD2\"],null,null,\"US\",null,null,null,null,null,false,null,null,null,null,\"en\",null,null,null,true,[null,[false,true,true],[false,true,false,false,true,false],false,[[[\"Academic - Other\",0.0021600637],[\"Coding\",0.0027598368],[\"Creative - Other\",4.4616542E-4],[\"Creative Writing\",0.0121444585],[\"Customer Support\",5.2729956E-5],[\"Daily Life Expert - Other\",0.0020381904],[\"Daily Life Personal - Other\",2.9994932E-4],[\"Data Analysis\",0.04713509],[\"Emotional Support\",6.9812324E-4],[\"Engagement - Other\",0.013681355],[\"Events\",7.471779E-5],[\"Finance / Accounting\",0.059295863],[\"Fitness\",3.536677E-5],[\"Games\",5.1106035E-4],[\"General Info Seeking\",0.059282515],[\"Government / Law\",4.7735375E-4],[\"HR / Career Management\",0.029996257],[\"Health\",3.2251858E-4],[\"Life Organizer\",2.795668E-4],[\"Lifelong Learning\",0.006139416],[\"Marketing \\u0026 Advertising\",0.014129314],[\"Meals / Nutrition\",0.0043