 maritime, and aviation broadband contracts, combined with high-margin Direct-to-Cell partnerships with global telecom operators, accelerate top-line recurring revenue.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Starship Operational Milestones\",[[0,31,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Transitioning Starship from test flights to routine orbital payload delivery radically drops the cost per kilogram to orbit. Successfully using Starship to deploy full-size next-gen Starlink satellites multiplies network capacity and lowers launch costs compared to Falcon 9.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Defense and Government Contracts\",[[0,32,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Expanded awards under the U.S. Space Force National Security Space Launch (NSSL) Phase 3, along with dedicated Starshield deployments and continued Artemis Human Landing System (HLS) milestones, secure multibillion-dollar backlogs with guaranteed margins.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Starlink IPO / Partial Spin-Off Talk\",[[0,36,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Any firm institutional step or SEC filing toward spinning out Starlink into a separate publicly traded company typically triggers a multiple re-rating on SpaceX’s holding valuation.\"]]]]],1]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Key Downside Risks\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Starship Development \\u0026 Reliability Bottlenecks\",[[0,46,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Any major setbacks in rapid reusability or in-orbit refueling could delay Artemis moon missions and bottleneck the deployment of higher-throughput Starlink constellations, prolonging expensive R\\u0026D cash burn.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Regulatory \\u0026 Environmental Friction\",[[0,35,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Stringent FAA launch licensing reviews, environmental challenges regarding the Starbase (Boca Chica) or Cape Canaveral footprints, and spectrum allocation disputes with terrestrial carriers or rival satellite operators could cap launch frequency.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Macro Liquidity \\u0026 Private Equity Constraints\",[[0,44,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"A sustained high-interest-rate environment or reduced secondary market liquidity could compress late-stage venture multiples, limiting the premium institutional investors are willing to pay during internal employee tender offers.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Rising\"]]]]],1]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[\"compress\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/compress/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1002,\"Don't personalize\",2,null,[\"person_cancel\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/person_cancel/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1001,\"Try again\",1,null,[\"refresh\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/refresh/default/24px.svg\",null,true]]]]],null,2,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,1]"]]
