 in-orbit refueling could delay Artemis moon missions and bottleneck the deployment of higher-throughput Starlink constellations, prolonging expensive R\\u0026D cash burn.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Regulatory \\u0026 Environmental Friction\",[[0,35,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Stringent FAA launch licensing reviews, environmental challenges regarding the Starbase (Boca Chica) or Cape Canaveral footprints, and spectrum allocation disputes with terrestrial carriers or rival satellite operators could cap launch frequency.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Macro Liquidity \\u0026 Private Equity Constraints\",[[0,44,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"A sustained high-interest-rate environment or reduced secondary market liquidity could compress late-stage venture multiples, limiting the premium institutional investors are willing to pay during internal employee tender offers.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Rising LEO Competition\",[[0,22,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Acceleration of competing low-Earth orbit megaconstellations (such as Amazon's Project Kuiper) could create pricing pressure in key commercial broadband and government communications markets.\"]]]]],1]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Citations \\u0026 Sources\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Morgan Stanley Research: Space Economy \\u0026 SpaceX Valuation Estimates\",[[0,67,[null,[\"https://www.morganstanley.com/ideas/investing-in-space\"]]]]]]]]]]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[\"compress\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/compress/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1002,\"Don't personalize\",2,